Description: KDE/Qt6 fan-curve editor for Juno (Clevo) laptops
 Live view of CPU temperature, fan RPM, and PWM duty with a draggable
 pwm = f(temp) curve chart matching the fancontrol control law. Presets are
 scraped from the fan-profile CLI so GUI and CLI never drift apart. Changes
 are applied through a root helper (pkexec/polkit) that writes /etc/fancontrol
 in fan-profile's byte format and restarts fancontrol.service, with automatic
 rollback if the daemon rejects the new config.
 .
 Requires the fan-profile/fancontrol stack (juno system fixes) and clevofan.
